{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep2/quest_story/12223010.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12223010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12223010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222301001:1":{"text":"レノマンさん、こんにちは！なんだかご機嫌ナナメみたいですけど、今度はどうしたんですか？","source_cn":"你好啊，莱诺曼！又出什么事了吗？你看起来好像很不高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC6F99C6CD02C6A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222301002:1":{"text":"それがね、あの専門家が突拍子もない思いつきで、ラスティーアンカーの魚類についての研究報告書を書くからって、この土地の魚類を全部集めるよう言われたのよ。","source_cn":"别提了。我跟随的那位专家突发奇想，要写一篇锈锚港鱼类研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79BFBB8B41F917D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222301003:1":{"text":"……全部よ！？熱帯の島に生息してるものも含めて全部！でも私は海に出られないし、買いつけることもできないし、困っちゃって……","source_cn":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7608A2E4EBA70EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222301003":{"text":"……全部よ！？熱帯の島に生息してるものも含めて全部！でも私は海に出られないし、買いつけることもできないし、困っちゃって……","source_cn":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出海，买也买不到，这不是刁难人吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7608A2E4EBA70EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222301004:1":{"text":"本当に？ありがとう！","source_cn":"真的可以吗？那就多谢了！","status":"matched